{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1063725-homebrew-vampire-merits","id":1063725,"title":"Homebrew Vampire Merits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-16T19:50:07-07:00","id":1063725,"title":"Homebrew Vampire Merits","content":"The latest thread for fan-made Merits meant for a specific splat. I'll be compiling the Merits I put together beforehand in here, as well as set up a GDoc once I got a sizable list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-17T04:59:27-07:00","id":1063810,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:red\">A Wanna Be Wyrm's Nest Merit (o)</span></span><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Nest Guardian (o), at least one dot of a Coil<br /> <b>Effect: </b>Your character gains a bonus based on what Coils they know. If the Nest Guardian is shared, use the total score, not the individual rating.<ul><li>As long as the Ascendant vampire has the Blush of Life, they heal as a human does on the Nest. Successfully meditating is considered the same as long term intensive care to the vampire's healing with successes equal to Nest Guardian + Coil dots</li> <li>Wyrm vampires gain their Nest Guardian dots as bonus willpower for purposes of dealing with frenzy (resisting, invoking, etc). This does not stack with Object Fetishism.</li> <li>Voivode vampires gain Herd dots equal to the lesser of Voivode/Nest Guardian. How this manifests can be anything from a pliable pseduo-cult to absorbing the energy of the Nest (similar to how vampires feed on ghosts and spirits), subject to ST approval.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}